# Doc Check Extensions (Workspace)

## Coverage Table

| Doc | Covers |
|---|---|
| `docs/architecture/overview.md` | System-level: services, roles, request flow |
| `docs/architecture/stargate.md` | `services/universal-stargate/` |
| `docs/architecture/gateway.md` | `services/_universal-llm-gateway/` |
| `docs/architecture/federation.md` | `systems/federation/`, federation config |
| `docs/architecture/routing.md` | `systems/proxy/`, routing, capacity |
| `docs/architecture/pipeline-system.md` | `pipelines/`, `systems/pipeline/` |
| `docs/architecture/libraries.md` | `libs/` |
| `docs/architecture/event-system.md` | Event factories, contracts, persistence |
| `docs/architecture/tools.md` | `tools/`, `scripts/` |
| `docs/architecture/configuration.md` | Config files, env vars, paths |

Use `docs/architecture/README_AI.md` as the routing index.

## Architecture-Relevant Paths

Filter changed files to: `services/`, `libs/`, `tools/`, `scripts/`,
`pipelines/`, `systems/`.

## Integration with /commit

If invoked from `/commit`: apply targeted `StrReplace` corrections and stage them.
